    <string name="export_footer_formats">Every practice, session and streak, and everything the server keeps about your account. PDF to read and print, JSON with everything, machine-readable, CSV as a ZIP with one table per kind of data. Your counts are decrypted on this phone, so the file holds them unencrypted: keep it somewhere private. No cover photos: they never leave the phone.</string>
